{"lines":[{"c":1,"t":"Sample answers for Writing tasks","x":0.09453449756132723,"y":0.069644833669097572,"h":0.018864138527949992,"w":0.32123077392578125},{"t":"TEST 6, WRITING TASK 1","c":1,"h":0.0234755975478389,"w":0.36063351949056,"x":0.094393855918708164,"y":0.1156945872503683},{"t":"SAMPLE ANSWER","w":0.20414388020833335,"c":1,"h":0.017651131633313777,"x":0.096465339444957721,"y":0.15265192993472576},{"x":0.096580755946636898,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 7.0 score. Here is the","y":0.18659489482113512,"w":0.80272694905598962,"h":0.021087772293000961,"c":1},{"x":0.096707821030253355,"y":0.20784883745864668,"h":0.014534882858869391,"w":0.20576131184895832,"t":"examiner's comment:","c":1},{"x":0.14394782767681791,"c":1,"y":0.24094587254870048,"w":0.73887166341145827,"t":"The candidate covers all the key features and presents a clear overview of the","h":0.019313522446703257},{"x":0.14388934220746952,"t":"developments planned. Information and ideas are logically organised and there is","h":0.021670286450425458,"y":0.25716888403303928,"w":0.76984654744466141,"c":1},{"w":0.77199930826822916,"h":0.023019126784253885,"c":1,"y":0.27434058685940299,"x":0.14382827890590819,"t":"a clear progression throughout the response. A range of cohesive devices is used"},{"y":0.29271529103404892,"x":0.14389336652981266,"w":0.76157669067382816,"c":1,"h":0.021549168688950515,"t":"flexibly [currently | Overall | First of all | therefore | Moreover | The next point | To"},{"c":1,"x":0.14388088319943496,"w":0.77399124145507803,"y":0.31043566398180866,"h":0.023431380308980176,"t":"sum up]. Lexical choice shows flexibility and precision, and includes less common"},{"h":0.019140164899882239,"w":0.79218109130859371,"t":"items [modifications | predicting | grouped in a shopping mall], though there is some","x":0.1440329113428902,"y":0.32979976449514981,"c":1},{"t":"inappropriate word choice [deserves]. A range of grammatical structures is used","x":0.14392910978560414,"y":0.3470576904016246,"c":1,"w":0.75538141886393229,"h":0.019919964955468106},{"y":0.36573744150417342,"t":"flexibly and accurately and error-free sentences are frequent.","x":0.14389357775853834,"c":1,"w":0.57846623738606762,"h":0.019830804831568738},{"w":0.80041152954101547,"h":0.017667844522968212,"t":"The two maps of the centre of the towns of Islip give information about the city","x":0.098765428659743762,"c":1,"y":0.40253239095190629},{"x":0.10071823168818374,"y":0.41892980005692038,"w":0.79855662027994789,"c":1,"h":0.020339684997486618,"t":"currently and in the future. Overall, a lot of modifications can be observed during the"},{"h":0.017406060361468967,"y":0.4401857131139042,"w":0.20197696685791017,"x":0.098571799425175424,"c":1,"t":"forecast development."},{"x":0.10276308049600279,"w":0.82536376953125012,"h":0.021904515152966098,"y":0.46181753358004241,"c":1,"t":"First of all, according to the current map the centre is close to a countryside. A main"},{"y":0.48391588343856529,"t":"road deserves houses, a school, several shops and a park.","x":0.098690195104953582,"h":0.014295130371345333,"c":1,"w":0.52895370483398441},{"w":0.80267684936523431,"h":0.020696210917370617,"c":1,"x":0.10278414429122582,"t":"Looking more closely at the map predicting the future development of the city, a lot","y":0.50576061552126583},{"x":0.1007621593530473,"h":0.015447567152331088,"c":1,"y":0.5246861166351876,"w":0.83138595581054686,"t":"of modifications can be observed. The size of the centre will increase in an oval shape;"},{"w":0.80674926757812493,"y":0.542441956661876,"x":0.10280149737014294,"c":1,"t":"therefore the countryside will disappear. Moreover, the single road will be replaced by a","h":0.01927091376099066},{"x":0.10272118239260711,"h":0.022615821398048741,"c":1,"y":0.55764448508491316,"t":"bigger dual carriageway. A pedestrian way will deserve the central area. New houses will","w":0.82544270833333333},{"y":0.57979976454236515,"c":1,"t":"be built with new facilities such as a bus station and a parking. The shops will be","w":0.80658437093098967,"x":0.10288065405068807,"h":0.014723203769140158},{"x":0.10269029571440209,"t":"grouped in a shopping mall. The next point is the garden area which will be smaller. As","w":0.82750498453776034,"h":0.02208113698431402,"c":1,"y":0.59432475646371852},{"c":1,"w":0.529033457438151,"t":"the city will have more people the school will be bigger.","y":0.61507503374784733,"x":0.10072026780932773,"h":0.020503894459934502},{"y":0.63867442896320048,"h":0.017345926084844199,"x":0.10278360283421251,"t":"To sum up, between the actual map of Islip town centre and the future planned","c":1,"w":0.75739237467447917},{"w":0.75525141398111983,"t":"development, a lot of modifications are predicted. On the one hand the city will","x":0.1048823596312343,"h":0.017249213511867922,"y":0.65729774464724389,"c":1},{"x":0.1026930757749336,"y":0.67032639922435977,"w":0.78019927978515613,"t":"be bigger with more facilities. On the other hand the park will be reduced and the","h":0.025161290477667353,"c":1},{"x":0.10482515412511698,"t":"countryside will disappear. The city will have changed a great deal.","w":0.62987055460611985,"y":0.69294803534985228,"h":0.020903334600765433,"c":1},{"w":0.037037035624186199,"t":"126","x":0.10699588542397126,"y":0.9447674416834505,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"w":0.20824633280436194,"h":0.016454192297478354,"y":0.96768258536995222,"t":"leltsresources.org","x":0.39483721299237268,"c":1}],"h":3395,"w":2400}